{"nodes":[{"feedJSON":{"media_type":"CAROUSEL_ALBUM","like_count":171,"comments_count":18,"caption":"Le gras c’est la vie ☀️\n\nNon non ce n’est pas une blague ☺️ le bon gras est essentiel au fonctionnement de notre organisme !\n\nOn a longtemps pointé du doigt le gras et limité ses apports mais ce n’est pas sans conséquences..\n\nAujourd’hui 80% de la population est carencée en oméga 3. Notre corps ne sachant pas les synthétiser, seule l’alimentation peut nous les apporter. \n\nJe te laisse découvrir les slides 📖 \n\nEt toi, as-tu aussi diabolisé le gras, ou peut-être est-ce toujours le cas ?","shortcode":"CgepH8SIzqq","children":{"data":[{"id":"17939597288236743","media":[{"rawOptions":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_874c01a687.jpeg","width":1080,"height":1080,"format":"webp"},"options":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_874c01a687.jpeg","width":1080,"height":1080,"format":"webp"},"src":"/_astro/17965964788751844_media_url_874c01a687_Z1RjbwV.webp","srcSet":{"values":[],"attribute":""},"attributes":{"width":1080,"height":1080,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}}]},{"id":"17929769837275802","media":[{"rawOptions":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_9c7b559000.jpeg","width":1080,"height":1080,"format":"webp"},"options":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_9c7b559000.jpeg","width":1080,"height":1080,"format":"webp"},"src":"/_astro/17965964788751844_media_url_9c7b559000_ZctWfY.webp","srcSet":{"values":[],"attribute":""},"attributes":{"width":1080,"height":1080,"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}}]},{"id":"17928258071434156","media":[{"rawOptions":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_a4d2acff95.jpeg","width":1080,"height":1080,"format":"webp"},"options":{"src":"https://ln-admin.laurenaturo.fr/uploads/17965964788751844_media_url_a4d2acff95.jpeg","width":1080,"height":10